{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>World23</strong>, a fast-paced top-down hack and slash RPG where every fight feels bigger, faster, and deadlier. You\u2019re <strong>Theo</strong> or <strong>Leo</strong>, elite agents dropped into hostile streets, shadowy metro tunnels, and enemy-controlled facilities. Your mission? Tear through anything that stands in your way.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/3b51f12892eb9611fcb5960fb156a832.poster.avif?t=1764895319\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/3b51f12892eb9611fcb5960fb156a832.webm?t=1764895319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/3b51f12892eb9611fcb5960fb156a832.mp4?t=1764895319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claws or sword. Lightning-fast combos or heavy strikes. Switch your weapon mid-fight to make it fit to your play style and the fight in front of you. Drop <strong>Gravity Dive</strong> to smash entire squads or bend reality with <strong>Quantum Rift</strong>, whatever it takes to walk out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/32338bfc2372208a125ed0c34787c233.poster.avif?t=1764895319\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/32338bfc2372208a125ed0c34787c233.webm?t=1764895319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/32338bfc2372208a125ed0c34787c233.mp4?t=1764895319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles that hit hard and drones screaming past as you sprint along subway rails. Hack terminals to unlock doors, disable defenses, or complete mission-critical objectives. Every mission changes it up with new layouts, fresh objectives, and hazards that keep you moving and thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/4c4d42db28ad99655ef350aff9d0d688.poster.avif?t=1764895319\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/4c4d42db28ad99655ef350aff9d0d688.webm?t=1764895319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/4c4d42db28ad99655ef350aff9d0d688.mp4?t=1764895319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play exclusively in couch co-op or online co-op. <strong>Stay together, fight as one, and cut through the chaos.</strong> The world of World23 is dangerous, unpredictable, and ready to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed top-down melee combat with RPG progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap weapons in the middle of combat to adapt instantly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big, satisfying abilities that clear the field</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven missions in a gritty sci-fi world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op play with shared objectives and tactics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied environments, including metro tunnels, urban battle zones, and enemy facilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up. Dive in. Own the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/a21a0b2d8427b7bb9099eedb246fcfe2.poster.avif?t=1764895319\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/a21a0b2d8427b7bb9099eedb246fcfe2.webm?t=1764895319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/a21a0b2d8427b7bb9099eedb246fcfe2.mp4?t=1764895319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734490?t=1764895319","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734490?t=1764895319","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/03cd3c0b168acf05430b0c6b0c37c76be75087a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764895319","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/03cd3c0b168acf05430b0c6b0c37c76be75087a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764895319","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3908310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>World23</strong>, a fast-paced top-down hack and slash RPG where every fight feels bigger, faster, and deadlier. You\u2019re <strong>Theo</strong> or <strong>Leo</strong>, elite agents dropped into hostile streets, shadowy metro tunnel